# Anomaly owns shared rendering gaps

When this pack needs a render capability the next Anomaly shader will also need, **file it on Anomaly** in the same turn (`Docs/Extensibility.md` Slice AI, `wiki/Framework-gaps.md`, shader-developer wiki canvas). Ship a temporary pack workaround only if the game must run today. Label it `// GAP: Slice AI — …`.

Do **not** Harmony-patch Keen pass methods to invent HDR lighting, IsolatedMix energy, or march LOD in this repo.

```text
# BAD
Guess an IsolatedMix multiply; read Keen frame_ fields as if they were stable.

# GOOD
Workaround + Anomaly extras/compose/helper destination. Append-only. Fail closed.
```
